{"root":"tiri","ipa":"/ti.ri/","core":"意为“继”或“抗拒、抵御”，通常与其他词组合构成复合词，表示非亲生关系或抵挡状态。","pos":["形容词","动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ti.ri/","zh":"继、抗拒","phrases":[{"t":"anak tiri","zh":"继子或继女"},{"t":"ayah tiri","zh":"继父"},{"t":"ibu tiri","zh":"继母"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia adalah anak tiri saya yang sangat baik.","zh":"他是一个非常好的我的继子。"},{"t":"Ibu tirinya memperlakukannya dengan penuh kasih sayang.","zh":"他的继母充满爱意地对待他。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"tiri","ipa":"/ti.ri/","zh":"继（家庭关系）","phrase":{"t":"orang tua tiri","zh":"继父母"},"example":{"t":"Mereka adalah orang tua tiri yang penyayang.","zh":"他们是慈爱的继父母。"}},{"w":"meniri","ipa":"/mə.ni.ri/","zh":"抗拒、抵御","phrase":{"t":"meniri angin","zh":"抵挡风寒"},"example":{"t":"Rumah itu kuat untuk meniri angin kencang.","zh":"那栋房子很结实，能抵御狂风。"}},{"w":"tertiri","ipa":"/tər.ti.ri/","zh":"被抗拒的、被抵御的","phrase":{"t":"serangan yang tertiri","zh":"被抵御住的进攻"},"example":{"t":"Serangan musuh berhasil tertiri oleh pasukan.","zh":"敌人的进攻被部队成功抵御了。"}},{"w":"penirian","ipa":"/pə.ni.ri.an/","zh":"抗拒、抵御的过程或行为","phrase":{"t":"penirian yang kuat","zh":"强有力的抵御"},"example":{"t":"Penirian mereka membuat musuh mundur.","zh":"他们的抵御使敌人退却了。"}},{"w":"bertiri","ipa":"/bər.ti.ri/","zh":"有抵抗力的、处于抵御状态的","phrase":{"t":"bertiri lama","zh":"持久抵抗"},"example":{"t":"Benteng itu masih bertiri meskipun diserang.","zh":"尽管受到攻击，那座城堡仍然处于抵抗状态。"}},{"w":"tertirikan","ipa":"/tər.ti.ri.kan/","zh":"被用来抵御的","phrase":{"t":"alat yang tertirikan","zh":"被用作抵御的工具"},"example":{"t":"Perisai itu tertirikan untuk melindungi diri.","zh":"那个盾牌被用来保护自己。"}},{"w":"keteririan","ipa":"/kə.tə.ri.ri.an/","zh":"抗拒性、抵御状态","phrase":{"t":"keteririan benteng","zh":"城堡的防御性"},"example":{"t":"Keteririan bangunan itu sangat baik.","zh":"那座建筑物的防御性能非常好。"}},{"w":"mempertirikan","ipa":"/məm.pər.ti.ri.kan/","zh":"使抗拒、使抵御","phrase":{"t":"mempertirikan posisi","zh":"巩固抵抗位置"},"example":{"t":"Mereka berusaha mempertirikan posisi pertahanan.","zh":"他们试图巩固防御阵地。"}},{"w":"terpertirikan","ipa":"/tər.pər.ti.ri.kan/","zh":"能够被使抵御的","ph